1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:02,563
(Leonard:)How about the toaster oven?

2
00:00:02,732 --> 00:00:04,442
(Sheldon:)What did the toaster oven ever do to you?

3
00:00:04,609 --> 00:00:06,989
What did I do to Jimmy Mullins
in the third grade?

4
00:00:07,153 --> 00:00:10,073
(Leonard:)He still punched me in the face
with my own fists.

5
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:15,246
(Leonard:)Sorry, you little nerd. You were just
in the wrong boys' room at the wrong time.

6
00:00:15,828 --> 00:00:17,958
(Howard:)Gentlemen, goggles.

7
00:00:18,122 --> 00:00:20,042
(Sheldon:)Yeah, this is an auspicious moment.

8
00:00:20,208 --> 00:00:22,958
(Sheldon:)Like Robert Oppenheimer
or Neil Armstrong...

9
00:00:23,127 --> 00:00:27,467
(Sheldon:)...we need the appropriate words
to mark this historic scientific event.

10
00:00:28,758 --> 00:00:31,348
How about, "Die, toaster, die"?

11
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,180
(Leonard:)That'll do it.

12
00:00:56,786 --> 00:00:58,866
(Raj(after watching complete destruction of toaster oven):)All right, what's next?

13
00:00:59,497 --> 00:01:01,997
No, I think I'm just gonna stay in tonight
and do laundry.

14
00:01:02,166 --> 00:01:06,026
[SCREAMS]

